Third-party code

The DDSM115 protocol layer (src/ddsm115_protocol.cpp,
include/robot_base_controller/ddsm115_protocol.hpp) and the architecture of
src/base_controller_node.cpp are derived from the
robot_4wd_dds115_base_controller project by alduxvm
(https://github.com/alduxvm/robot_4wd_dds115_base_controller), which declares
the BSD license in its package manifest and is itself inspired by
belovictor/ros_ddsm115_driver. The portions derived from that project remain
under its BSD license and copyright.
